# IOC (Inversion of Container)

Ioc is designed Principle in software development where the Control of Objects Creation & Dependency Managment is transferred from the application code into a framework or container.

********PROBLEM WITH NEW KEYWORD*********
-> Tight coupling
-> No dependecy injection 

---> new employee() -> Employee Objects
   --> Spring created Object of employee --> EMployee Bean.

Note :- if Objects is created and managed by Spring is called as Bean.

Q. How to create Spring to Objects?
ANS-> With the help of IOC COntainer
1. it is a core part of spring Framework.
2. Responsible for Object Managment.

** SPRING Provide two IOc COntainer
1. BeanFactory  -> is type of IOC container (INTERFACE)
2. APPlication Context. (INTERFACE) classPathXMlApplicationContext(LATEST)


